   "license": "CC BY-SA 2.5",
   "body_html": "@chuck: Like <code>char* paths = malloc(123); paths = getenv(&quot;PATH&quot;);</code>? The pointer to the malloc-ed memory will be overridden so it&#39;ll just be leaked."
